<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>ログイン - KiNote</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            font-family: "Hiragino Mincho ProN", "Yu Mincho", "MS Mincho", serif;
            background: #4D5D70;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        .container {
            background: white;
            padding: 0;
            border: 1px solid #000000;
            width: 400px;
        }
        .header {
            background: #4D5D70;
            padding: 20px 30px;
            color: #FFE498;
            font-size: 32px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }
        .form-body {
            padding: 30px;
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 400;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            color: #333;
        }
        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        label {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            color: #333;
            font-size: 16px;
        }
        input {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px;
            font-size: 16px;
            border: 1px solid #000000;
            font-family: inherit;
        }
        button {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 14px;
            font-size: 18px;
            background: #4D5D70;
            color: white;
            border: 2px solid #4D5D70;
            border-radius: 10px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-family: inherit;
            transition: all 0.2s;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }
        button:hover {
            background: #3a4a5a;
        }
        .links {
            margin-top: 24px;
            line-height: 2;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #666;
        }
        .links a {
            color: #4D5D70;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .links a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">KiNote</div>
        <div class="form-body">
            <h1>ログイン</h1>
            <form action="/login" method="POST">
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="email">メールアドレス</label>
                    <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="password">パスワード</label>
                    <input type="password" id="password" name="password" required>
                </div>
                <button type="submit">ログイン</button>
            </form>
            <div class="links">
                学校別メンバー管理の方は、<a href="/login/school">こちら</a><br>
                新規登録の方は、<a href="/login/register">こちら</a><br>
                パスワードをお忘れの方は、<a href="/login/forgot-password">こちら</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>